#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:3
#: cfa1f461b42c4ae2b6626db80c5c6c5c
msgid "设置磁矩（Set Magnetic Moments）"
msgstr "Set Magnetic Moments"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:5
#: 0d1482a008944d358fdcf6a5a313fa23
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:7
#: 7d16d02b4eec44818fa4426d32976316
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:9
#: 768ed935d51542f697a08848cff24f38
msgid ""
"把输入结构写成统一的 `spin:R:3` 表示。选择磁矩来源（已有磁矩 / 元素映射 / 常数幅值）、输出格式（标量 / "
"向量）、参考轴方向和生效元素范围。这是一张基础层卡片——不生成多磁序分支，只为后续磁性卡片提供干净、统一的初始磁矩。内部仍同步维护 ASE "
"`initial_magmoms` 兼容别名。"
msgstr ""
"Write a consistent `spin:R:3` representation to each input structure. "
"Choose the moment source—existing values, an element map, or a constant "
"magnitude—the scalar or vector output format, a reference axis, and the "
"elements to which it applies. This foundational card does not branch into"
" multiple magnetic orders; it prepares a clean, uniform starting state "
"for downstream magnetic cards. The internal ASE `initial_magmoms` "
"compatibility alias is kept in sync."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:11
#: 7630ce3746834cd4a0227e17b21d1afb
#
msgid ""
"**和 `磁序` 的区别：** `磁序` 从一个母相出发生成 FM+AFM+PM "
"多分支。本卡只标准化磁矩格式，不创建新磁序。如果你的流程里多张磁性卡都在重复配 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）和 "
"`轴`（`axis`），用本卡统一初始化一次可以消除重复。"
msgstr ""
"**Difference from `Magnetic Order`:** `Magnetic Order` generates FM, AFM,"
" and PM branches from one parent phase. This card only standardizes the "
"magnetic-moment representation; it does not create a new magnetic order. "
"If several downstream magnetic cards repeat the same `magmom_map` and "
"`axis`, initialize them once here."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:13
#: df369c2e121a4b37beca50f67bca47fa
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:15
#: 2e224c4ee7b544f398a587d2f252f830
msgid "这张卡执行的是确定性映射而不是磁结构求解。对元素为 $e$ 的原子 $i$，标量模式写入"
msgstr ""
"This card performs a deterministic mapping rather than solving for a "
"magnetic structure. For atom $i$ of element $e$, scalar mode writes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:17
#: 37f597ee169a4be29138d59de74f9058
msgid ""
"\n"
"m_i=M(e),\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:21
#: f5514473733e41339e91067a81f3d475
msgid "非共线模式写入"
msgstr "Non-collinear mode writes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:23
#: a03b7fac3bf74e56926b21d459191c11
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf m_i=M(e)\\,\n"
"\\frac{\\mathbf a_e}{\\|\\mathbf a_e\\|},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:28
#: 794dc61b9c994d34bc5f94d4989f9a89
msgid ""
"其中 $M(e)$ 来自元素-磁矩表，$\\mathbf a_e$ 来自元素方向表；没有独立方向时使用全局 "
"参考轴。未列元素按“默认磁矩”处理。数值单位为 $\\mu_B$。它只设置 `initial_magmoms` "
"初始标签，不会计算交换作用、自动判断磁性元素或保证 DFT 收敛到该磁态。"
msgstr ""
"Here $M(e)$ comes from the element-moment map and $\\mathbf a_e$ from the"
" element-direction map; when no element-specific direction is given, the "
"global reference axis is used. Unlisted elements use the default moment. "
"Values are in $\\mu_B$. The card only sets the initial `initial_magmoms` "
"labels; it neither computes exchange interactions nor identifies magnetic"
" elements automatically, and it cannot guarantee that DFT converges to "
"the requested magnetic state."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:32
#: 7c275cd7e9b843188051b848df73776f
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:34
#: 3709c5f1327a4463b9cb2c76f05874ea
msgid "场景：多张磁性卡各自配 magmom_map，配错了一处"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: repeated `magmom_map` settings drift out of sync across "
"magnetic cards"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:36
#: ecd97cbebd52411f84681d8c6191997c
#
msgid ""
"你的训练流水线里有 `磁序` → `局域磁响应` → `SOC / 纹理响应` 三张磁性卡。如果在多张卡里重复填写元素磁矩，两周后调整 Co "
"的磁矩时很容易漏改其中一处，导致同一批数据使用不一致的幅值。"
msgstr ""
"Suppose a training pipeline contains `Magnetic Order` → `Local Magnetic "
"Response` → `SOC / Texture Response`. If element moments are entered "
"repeatedly on several cards, a later change to the Co moment can easily "
"be missed in one place, causing inconsistent magnitudes within the same "
"dataset."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:38
#: 0c249025ef3b44a387506e77804a3672
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 磁性流水线里，磁矩幅值的定义应该只在一处。用本卡在最前面做一次统一初始化，后续磁性卡全部选 \"Existing "
"initial magmoms\" 模式，不再各自定义 magmom_map。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Define moment magnitudes once in a magnetic workflow. Put "
"this card first, then select `Existing initial magmoms` in downstream "
"cards instead of redefining the element map repeatedly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:40
#: 8f9eb5162eeb4ff693b67d377a5d9003
msgid "**输入：** 一个磁性晶体结构，还没写 `spin` 或 `initial_magmoms`"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A magnetic crystal structure without `spin` or "
"`initial_magmoms`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:42
#: 32cfd9804b744f5e9b6bcef1b9fd2ba1
msgid "**目标：** 统一写入向量格式的初始磁矩，Fe 取 2.2 μB，Co 取 1.7 μB，沿 z 轴，后续卡片全部复用"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Initialize vector moments along *z*, using 2.2 μB for Fe and "
"1.7 μB for Co, then reuse them throughout the downstream workflow."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:44
#: 29c3e82a712f48c78453ad7bccc3f2a5
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:45
#: f579eec4786646ba8df41dcc59bf3d61
msgid "`来源`（`source`） = `Map/default magnitude`"
msgstr "`Source` (`source`) = `Map/default magnitude`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:46
#: 9b677957a445439d908c304249a0b2ee
msgid "`格式`（`format`） = `Non-collinear (vector)`"
msgstr "`Format` (`format`) = `Non-collinear (vector)`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:47
#: e17d3a4b5613469e92e3ebde29710f73
msgid "`元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`） = `Fe:2.2,Co:1.7`"
msgstr "`Element moment map` (`magmom_map`) = `Fe:2.2,Co:1.7`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:48
#: 5ac1f3565e0f4d9aa237f393399e0724
msgid "`Apply Elements` = `Fe,Co`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:50
#: 82af73984e5a42dc9a914c0a3ef1eedf
msgid "**输出：** 1 个结构，带 `MagSet(map,vec)` 标签和 `spin:R:3` 数组。原子位置和数量不变。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** One structure labeled `MagSet(map,vec)` with a `spin:R:3` "
"array. Atomic positions and counts are unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:52
#: bcb4b29a9e5a40c9930dab8fd8f835ce
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:53
#: 18aded8398d34157b78738ee5ee4ac0d
msgid "后续磁性卡全部切到 \"Existing initial magmoms\"，检查输出磁矩幅值是否一致"
msgstr ""
"Set all downstream magnetic cards to `Existing initial magmoms` and "
"verify that moment magnitudes remain consistent."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:54
#: b3833a0c71254922b9f94eeea9146129
msgid "如果 Co 的磁矩需要精确到实验值，直接用 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）的精确定义"
msgstr ""
"If the Co moment must match a specific experimental value, enter that "
"value explicitly in the element moment map (`magmom_map`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:55
#: 31111d830702433e87538054466d9606
msgid "如果后续要同时跑标量和向量流程，分别用本卡输出两种格式的版本，而不是在后面卡片里切换"
msgstr ""
"If both scalar and vector workflows are needed, create one standardized "
"branch for each format here instead of switching representations later."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:57
#: 988d42c6c4d740d394428d304605226a
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:59
#: b3bb769514e049ad930500c24721bbc7
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:60
#: 28d4213bb92a410caf30c8f8e389dcba
msgid "流水线里多张磁性卡都在重复配置磁矩幅值、格式、axis"
msgstr ""
"Several magnetic cards repeat the same moment magnitudes, format, and "
"axis."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:61
#: cbc0741613fb49648cf36730968e6e9c
msgid "输入结构的磁矩格式不统一（有的标量有的向量），需要标准化"
msgstr "Input structures mix scalar and vector moments and must be standardized."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:62
#: 00a242374f354f258bd4c9ab91797b6a
msgid "只想初始化参考 FM 磁矩，不想生成多磁序分支"
msgstr ""
"You need one reference FM initialization without branching into several "
"magnetic orders."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:64
#: a4f0848e0f074372a61dd59b9457931b
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:65
#: dd60285069b14eda82680969853aecb6
msgid "只有一张磁性卡且不共享磁矩配置 → 直接在目标卡上配也可以"
msgstr ""
"Only one magnetic card uses the settings → configuring that card directly"
" may be simpler."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:66
#: 813b8955c24e477bb8eedbac2ee012d0
#
msgid "需要一次性生成 FM/AFM/PM 多磁序 → 用 `磁序` 一步完成"
msgstr "You need FM, AFM, and paramagnetic-like branches → use `Magnetic Order`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:68
#: d105c08687bc4c06915f7e91a75d1526
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:70
#: 0cc7e8fb4117450a995194474573bcdc
msgid "磁矩来源"
msgstr "Moment source"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:72
#: ae8cbd060c1246d99e2b40559ec64d82
msgid "来源（source）"
msgstr "source"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:74
#: ead7f25a82cb49e1b8ab5162b1ead427
msgid "`str`，默认 `'Map/default magnitude'`。磁矩从哪里来。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Map/default magnitude'`. Source from which moment "
"values are obtained."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: 5a383f0f400d44c4b09f1b50de7da361
msgid "选项"
msgstr "Option"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: 9fd6dec1ad4a48ffbc797eae26f47a93
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: 101c5da29161495c8d8354d6e7dccafb
msgid "`Map/default magnitude`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: 3443b3fb70fd4e4da0efab2e33afc6b0
msgid "用 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`） / `默认磁矩`（`default_moment`）生成。输入不需要已有磁矩"
msgstr ""
"Generate moments from the element moment map (`magmom_map`) and default "
"moment (`default_moment`). The input does not need existing moments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: 2e59582d0c284da5aa79cfc8cecde7eb
msgid "`Existing initial magmoms`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: 596a124bd8c947d3b9454fd593715804
msgid "保留输入已有的磁矩，只做格式转换。输入需要已有 `initial_magmoms`"
msgstr ""
"Preserve existing moment values and convert only their representation; "
"the input must contain `initial_magmoms`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: b581397ab6c64d138aad220ef5cf804d
msgid "`Constant magnitude`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md
#: 5fd9224a56844038bdcef04b0a4f779f
msgid "所有目标元素统一用一个常数幅值，适合快速扫参考值"
msgstr ""
"Assign one constant magnitude to all target elements; useful for a quick "
"reference-value scan."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:82
#: 42db88b9b4e7469192fac1fc071bae32
msgid "元素磁矩表（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:84
#: c257b3b6fbff42e5b22b27988a879035
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `''`。界面使用“元素 / 磁矩或向量”表格；标量可填 `2.2`，向量可填 `[0,0,1.0]`。序列化仍兼容 "
"`Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6` 和 `{\"Cr\":[0,0,1.0]}`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `''`. The interface uses an `Element / Moment or vector` "
"table; enter `2.2` for a scalar or `[0,0,1.0]` for a vector. "
"Serialization remains compatible with `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6` and "
"`{\"Cr\":[0,0,1.0]}`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:86
#: fc20e76bd77947f8a8c0d4c335c130c2
msgid "使用元素方向（use_element_dirs）"
msgstr "use_element_dirs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:88
#: 7b73c09a1948466a99f33b0925419eb1
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `False`。勾选后 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）中提供的向量方向会被保留，而不是统一投到 "
"`轴`（`axis`）。仅向量格式下有意义。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `False`. When enabled, vector directions supplied in "
"`magmom_map` are preserved instead of being projected onto `axis`. This "
"setting only applies to vector output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:90
#: 00ec0b129b1f4a68a1d4eafe94a8d796
msgid "默认磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:92
#: 1f946fdd65ab43c69dc88f013c08e830
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.0`。`元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）未命中元素的默认幅值。设 0 则不给未配置元素写磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.0`. Default magnitude for elements not present in "
"`magmom_map`. A value of 0 leaves unconfigured elements without a moment."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:94
#: 4c1741117f0d4e868a4109d6ff5a6a00
msgid "固定磁矩（constant_moment）"
msgstr "constant_moment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:96
#: c2f22455d22843d59c340ff5d150646e
msgid "`float`，默认 `2.0`。`Source = Constant magnitude` 时所有目标元素的统一幅值。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `2.0`. Magnitude assigned to every target element when "
"`Source = Constant magnitude`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:98
#: 838d9a4b1a984a58898cccf09c2a299e
msgid "输出格式"
msgstr "Output representation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:100
#: d6baa8dde55e4e1586d1dc8e50b5519f
msgid "格式（format）"
msgstr "format"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:102
#: 51ee917b642f419b9409856c06d395e2
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Non-collinear (vector)'`。`Collinear (scalar)` 或 `Non-collinear"
" (vector)`。后续要做旋转、螺旋、canting 时优先选向量格式。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Non-collinear (vector)'`. Choose `Collinear (scalar)` "
"or `Non-collinear (vector)`. Use vectors for downstream rotation, spiral,"
" or canting operations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:104
#: 6b7818fab2b74929b248aba0937ea91d
msgid "标量磁矩转为矢量（lift_scalar）"
msgstr "lift_scalar"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:106
#: 4f2f910a3ffb4b35ac087f95d1aa7889
msgid "`bool`，默认 `True`。输入是标量且目标格式是向量时，是否沿 `轴`（`axis`）抬升。通常保持开启。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `True`. When scalar input is converted to vector output, "
"lift it along `axis`. Normally leave this enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:108
#: e3644d3c7a8a40a2a532b0775047a843
msgid "轴（axis）"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:110
#: 38d882b7792c4812a11f92f25619cf55
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, "
"1.0)`。向量输出的参考方向、标量抬升的方向，格式为 `[x, y, z]`。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. "
"Reference direction for generated vectors and for lifting scalar moments,"
" expressed as `[x, y, z]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:112
#: f0ea3e94b7a647c589252718a11bab4b
msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式都会使用。"
msgstr ""
"Used by modes that depend on a direction, layering, a surface, or vector "
"initialization."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:114
#: a31c97a94a714f6795e247865c161d51
msgid "元素范围"
msgstr "Element scope"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:116
#: 4faaad3d1e79446e8b83ddf155b1fde8
msgid "应用元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "apply_elements"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:118
#: a36b90d1cfa24a568736036caa4930b2
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。逗号分隔如 `Fe,Co`，只对列出的元素写磁矩，其余写 0。留空则全部生效。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Comma-separated element symbols such as `Fe,Co`. "
"Only listed elements receive moments; others are set to zero. Leave empty"
" to include all elements."

