#: c52a1c67135b45ceb77fc16172d44b7d
#
msgid "`设置磁矩` → `磁序`：先统一磁矩格式，再生成 FM/AFM/PM 磁序"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Magnetic Order`: standardize representation, "
"then generate FM, AFM, and paramagnetic-like orders."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:176
#: 680d9474732a4d6e89ac1b76345643bc
