msgstr "`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Local Magnetic Response`: create consistent FM vector moments before scanning local responses"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:177
#: 0b44ede6dbc0446491ae54af3a46d906
#
msgid "`设置磁矩` → `SOC / 纹理响应`：先写入稳定模长，再生成有限 q 磁纹理"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` → `SOC / Texture Response`: establish stable "
"moment magnitudes before generating finite-q magnetic textures"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:179
#: 92e135ccd4f548f49f86a3ab9af6da1e
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:181
#: c814c08fbb3f492e9f6c061acd023e99
msgid ""
"**输出没有磁矩。** 检查 `来源`（`source`）模式是否匹配输入。`Existing` 模式优先读取 "
"`spin:R:3`，没有时才读取旧 `initial_magmoms`。`Map/default` 需要填写 "
"`元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）或合理的 `默认磁矩`（`default_moment`）。"
msgstr ""
"**The output has no magnetic moments.** Check that `source` matches the "
"input. `Existing` first reads `spin:R:3` and falls back to legacy "
"`initial_magmoms`; `Map/default` requires an element moment map "
"(`magmom_map`) or a suitable default moment (`default_moment`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:183
#: dcd71cc3e350417b868a90cd71020a7a
msgid ""
"**标量磁矩没变成向量。** `标量磁矩转为矢量`（`lift_scalar`）没开，且 `格式`（`format`）选了向量但输入只有标量。开启"
" `标量磁矩转为矢量`（`lift_scalar`）。"
msgstr ""
"**Scalar moments were not converted to vectors.** Vector output was "
"selected but `lift_scalar` is disabled. Enable `Convert scalar moments to"
" vectors` (`lift_scalar`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:185
#: 882dd5ee010d4cb8ad28c86296faad02
msgid "**某些元素磁矩被意外清零。** 检查 `应用元素`（`apply_elements`）是否为非空且遗漏了目标元素。"
msgstr ""
"**Moments on some elements were unexpectedly cleared.** Check whether the"
" nonempty `apply_elements` list omits the intended element."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:187
#: e586efa64374493fb6274c872cb3b6ae
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:189
#: 44697cbfa46541c7a4d6ad08b25d42b6
msgid ""
"`MagSet(existing,sca)` / `MagSet(map,vec)` / `MagSet(const,vec)` "
"等：标记磁矩来源和输出格式"
msgstr ""
"`MagSet(existing,sca)`, `MagSet(map,vec)`, or `MagSet(const,vec)`, "
"recording the moment source and output representation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:191
#: 5cfa828ca1eb447eb83b0623621f6996
msgid "所有导出输出写入 `spin:R:3`。标量格式必须提供非零 `轴`（`axis`），程序据此构造三分量自旋，不会静默假设方向。"
msgstr ""
"Every exported output writes `spin:R:3`. Scalar format requires a nonzero"
" `axis`, which is used to construct three-component spins; the program "
"never assumes a direction silently."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:193
#: d3f4ab332c32401fb7f9ae5849f20208
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:195
#: 0882b414ecae4b99b485fcfdc264f3a1
msgid "无随机性。相同输入、相同 `来源`（`source`）和相同参数 → 严格一致输出。"
msgstr ""
"There is no randomness. Identical input, `source`, and parameters produce"
" identical output."

#~ msgid "所有输出写入 `initial_magmoms` 数组。"
#~ msgstr "All outputs are written to the `initial_magmoms` array."
